{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0003-longest-substring-without-repeating","title":"LeetCode 3 无重复字符的最长子串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0003-longest-substring-without-repeating","wordCount":1130,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-3-无重复字符的最长子串\">LeetCode 3 无重复字符的最长子串</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个字符串 <code>s</code>，请你找出其中不含有重复字符的<strong>最长子串</strong>的长度。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>s = &quot;abcabcbb&quot;</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>3</code></li>\n<li>解释：无重复字符的最长子串是 <code>&quot;abc&quot;</code>，其长度为 3。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>s = &quot;bbbbb&quot;</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>1</code></li>\n<li>解释：无重复字符的最长子串是 <code>&quot;b&quot;</code>，其长度为 1。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>s = &quot;pwwkew&quot;</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>3</code></li>\n<li>解释：无重复字符的最长子串是 <code>&quot;wke&quot;</code>，其长度为 3。注意答案必须是子串的长度，<code>&quot;pwke&quot;</code> 是子序列而非子串。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 5 * 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>s</code> 由英文字母、数字、符号和空格组成</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本题是滑动窗口的经典入门题目。核心难点在于如何高效地维护窗口内字符的唯一性，并在发现重复时正确收缩左边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"暴力解法分析\">暴力解法分析</h3><p>最直观的思路是枚举所有子串，对每个子串判断是否包含重复字符。枚举起点 i 和终点 j 需要 O(n²)，判断重复需要 O(n)，总时间复杂度 O(n³)。当字符串长度达到 5 万时，这个复杂度完全不可接受。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滑动窗口优化\">滑动窗口优化</h3><p>滑动窗口的核心思想是维护一个「当前无重复」的区间 <code>[left, right]</code>，通过右指针扩展探索新字符、左指针收缩消除重复，从而在 O(n) 时间内遍历所有可能的无重复子串。</p>\n<p>具体步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用一个哈希集合（或哈希映射）记录窗口内的字符</li>\n<li>右指针 <code>right</code> 不断向右移动，尝试将新字符加入窗口</li>\n<li>如果新字符已存在于窗口中，移动左指针 <code>left</code> 直到窗口中不再包含该重复字符</li>\n<li>每次扩展后，更新最大长度 <code>maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, right - left + 1)</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么滑动窗口有效？</strong> 因为当 <code>right</code> 处遇到重复字符时，以 <code>left</code> 到重复字符首次出现位置之间的任何位置为起点的子串都不可能超过当前最优解，所以可以安全地跳过这些起点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进一步优化-哈希映射记录索引\">进一步优化：哈希映射记录索引</h3><p>用 <code>Map&lt;string, number&gt;</code> 记录每个字符最后出现的位置。当遇到重复字符时，直接将 <code>left</code> 跳到该字符上次出现位置的下一位，无需逐步收缩，虽然时间复杂度仍是 O(n)，但常数因子更小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>三重循环，超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口 + Set</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(min(n,m))</td>\n<td>左指针逐步收缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口 + Map</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(min(n,m))</td>\n<td>左指针跳跃收缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 m 为字符集大小。对于 ASCII 字符集，m = 128。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-滑动窗口-set\">方法一：滑动窗口 + Set</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function lengthOfLongestSubstring(s: string): number {&#10;  const window = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let maxLen = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let right = 0; right &lt; s.length; right++) {&#10;    while (window.has(s[right])) {&#10;      window.delete(s[left]);&#10;      left++;&#10;    }&#10;    window.add(s[right]);&#10;    maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, right - left + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLen;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lengthOfLongestSubstring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> window</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s[right])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s[left]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s[right]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxLen, right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-滑动窗口-map-优化版\">方法二：滑动窗口 + Map（优化版）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function lengthOfLongestSubstring(s: string): number {&#10;  const lastIndex = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let maxLen = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let right = 0; right &lt; s.length; right++) {&#10;    const char = s[right];&#10;    if (lastIndex.has(char) &amp;&amp; lastIndex.get(char)! &gt;= left) {&#10;      left = lastIndex.get(char)! + 1;&#10;    }&#10;    lastIndex.set(char, right);&#10;    maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, right - left + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLen;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lengthOfLongestSubstring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lastIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s[right];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lastIndex.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(char) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastIndex.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(char)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastIndex.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(char)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lastIndex.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(char, right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxLen, right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键细节：</strong> 在 Map 版本中，<code>lastIndex.get(char)! &gt;= left</code> 这个判断至关重要。如果字符上次出现的位置在 <code>left</code> 左侧，说明该字符已经不在当前窗口内，不需要收缩。</p>\n<h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>s = &quot;abcabcbb&quot;</code> 为例，展示 Map 版本的执行过程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>char</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>lastIndex</th>\n<th>maxLen</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>a</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>{a:0}</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>{a:0,b:1}</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>c</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>{a:0,b:1,c:2}</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>a</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>{a:3,b:1,c:2}</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>{a:3,b:4,c:2}</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>c</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>{a:3,b:4,c:5}</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>{a:3,b:6,c:5}</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>{a:3,b:7,c:5}</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Set 版本</th>\n<th>Map 版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)，每个字符最多被访问两次</td>\n<td>O(n)，每个字符仅访问一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(min(n, m))，m 为字符集大小</td>\n<td>O(min(n, m))，m 为字符集大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> Set 版本中，<code>right</code> 指针遍历一遍字符串走 n 步，<code>left</code> 指针在整个过程中最多也走 n 步（每个字符最多被 delete 一次），所以总共 2n 次操作，即 O(n)。Map 版本更优，<code>left</code> 可以直接跳跃，不需要逐步删除。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 哈希结构最多存储 min(n, m) 个键值对，其中 n 为字符串长度，m 为字符集大小。当输入为全 ASCII 字符时，空间上限为 O(128) = O(1)。</p>\n<p>本题是滑动窗口模式的基础模板题。掌握「右扩左缩」的双指针框架后，可以推广到许多类似的子串/子数组问题，如最小覆盖子串（LC #76）、串联所有单词的子串（LC #30）等。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 3 无重复字符的最长子串","id":"leetcode-3-无重复字符的最长子串"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"暴力解法分析","id":"暴力解法分析"},{"level":3,"text":"滑动窗口优化","id":"滑动窗口优化"},{"level":3,"text":"进一步优化：哈希映射记录索引","id":"进一步优化-哈希映射记录索引"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：滑动窗口 + Set","id":"方法一-滑动窗口-set"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：滑动窗口 + Map（优化版）","id":"方法二-滑动窗口-map-优化版"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 142 环形链表 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0142-linked-list-cycle-ii"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 5 最长回文子串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0005-longest-palindromic-substring"}}